<Base title="Privacy" description="What YaY NYC collects when you visit or send us a report, why we collect it, and how to ask us to delete it.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>YaY NYC does not ask you to sign up. We measure visits with Google Analytics (pages viewed, rough location, device) to learn what is useful; it uses cookies. If you send a report through the contact form, we keep what you wrote and, if you give it, your email, only to follow up.</p>
  <p>"Near me" uses your location in your browser only to sort the list; it is not sent to us.</p>
  <p>Questions or deletion requests: use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
</Base>
